# WAVE AIR needs travel (gaps.json minMeters 3): a full ollie standing on top of the wave flies
# 107 ticks but goes nowhere and pays nothing (it paid 150 every hop); rolling over it at 5 m/s and
# ollieing off the top, 144 ticks and about 6 m, is WAVE AIR.
park soma
cmd 0 teleport 55 26.5 -0.4 90
hold ollie 20..50
cmd 400 teleport 50 26.5 -0.8 90
cmd 430 speed 5
hold ollie 460..510
run 800
expect event land{airTicks=107} within 156..160
expect event gap{id=wave} count == 1
expect event gap{id=wave,points=150} within 653..657
expect event comboLanded{name=WAVE AIR,points=150} within 665..669
expect no event bail
